WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.077
Want to rehearse against your opponent before the game? Play their bot.

00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:07.188
On your opponent's page, tap Play their bot.

00:00:07.638 --> 00:00:12.517
Pick your colour, and the strength. It starts at their FIDE rating. Then tap Play.

00:00:12.967 --> 00:00:19.617
The bot opens the way they do. Firouzja played d4 in 65 of these games. Now it's your move.

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:22.365
Tap a piece, then tap where it goes.

00:00:22.815 --> 00:00:26.905
It answers from their games, and tells you how often they played each move.

00:00:27.355 --> 00:00:30.784
Want to practise a different line? Tap one of the other moves,

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:39.399
and the bot plays that instead. Green moves come from their real games. After the opening, an engine plays at the strength you chose.

00:00:39.849 --> 00:00:43.171
Rehearse your next game. chesspreparatory.com.
